WEBVTT

00:02.964 --> 00:05.264
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:05.404 --> 00:08.424
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.934 --> 00:11.674
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.674 --> 00:16.304
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.744 --> 00:23.704
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:25.454 --> 00:28.324
Dragon Drive

00:28.324 --> 00:33.824
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.964 --> 00:36.934
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.934 --> 00:40.164
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.674 --> 00:45.044
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:45.044 --> 00:47.014
ima mo
I'd still...

00:47.014 --> 00:53.314
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:55.054 --> 00:57.424
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:57.424 --> 01:00.614
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.954 --> 01:05.964
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.964 --> 01:07.524
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.664 --> 01:10.064
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:10.064 --> 01:13.194
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.604 --> 01:18.674
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.674 --> 01:21.414
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:21.414 --> 01:29.074
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:41.264 --> 01:42.734
Who the hell are you?

01:42.794 --> 01:43.994
Let me take a look.

01:45.434 --> 01:46.404
Mahiru!

01:48.034 --> 01:52.664
You saw my brother die,
and came back like nothing had happened!

01:52.744 --> 01:56.544
These dragons are all alive,
protected by a special film.

01:56.614 --> 01:59.084
As a result, they've obtained eternal life!

01:59.144 --> 02:00.874
Can you not hear the dragons here?

02:01.114 --> 02:03.554
They're angry!

02:03.654 --> 02:05.584
Don't be foolish.

02:05.754 --> 02:07.684
How could they be anything but happy?

02:13.534 --> 02:17.094
Eternal Life

02:36.824 --> 02:39.514
I'm showing you your way out!

02:39.654 --> 02:41.984
Ouch! Oww!!

02:44.994 --> 02:49.124
I will take good care of your dragons.

02:49.534 --> 02:52.524
There's no need to worry,
so go back to wherever you came from.

02:55.304 --> 02:56.794
I'll never agree with your ways!

02:56.874 --> 02:58.564
I'll make you return Chibi to me!

02:58.644 --> 03:01.044
Well, have a nice day.

03:01.844 --> 03:03.364
W-Wait!

03:06.384 --> 03:07.574
Open up!

03:07.654 --> 03:09.174
Give Chibi back to me!

03:09.254 --> 03:11.414
Come on. Calm down.

03:11.654 --> 03:14.624
The best thing to do now
is to think hard and come up with a plan.

03:15.294 --> 03:17.194
Doesn't this bother you, Mr. Taiyou?

03:17.364 --> 03:19.454
Lai Lai Cocoon has also
been captured by them!

03:19.694 --> 03:21.124
I know that!

03:22.294 --> 03:23.264
Mr. Taiyou.

03:30.034 --> 03:33.534
Perhaps the day is drawing near
when I will see you again.

03:36.914 --> 03:38.674
I'll never let anyone die again.

03:39.144 --> 03:42.484
I will protect the dragons forever.

03:52.394 --> 03:55.924
I shouldn't have said that
I was good at searching for things.

03:56.434 --> 03:59.494
How am I supposed to find
anything with no leads?

04:02.974 --> 04:04.494
Meguru.

04:04.574 --> 04:06.834
I sure hope you'll remember.

04:11.284 --> 04:13.844
I appreciate it, Kyoji.

04:14.384 --> 04:15.854
Don't worry about it.

04:16.154 --> 04:19.514
I've become somewhat used to
getting into trouble.

04:20.294 --> 04:22.014
You'll see him again, won't you?

04:22.294 --> 04:24.194
Huh? Yeah.

04:28.794 --> 04:29.764
Mahiru.

04:31.364 --> 04:33.804
I won't be able to help you any further...

04:34.304 --> 04:36.534
...in my present condition.

04:36.734 --> 04:39.534
Yeah. I owe you one.

04:39.644 --> 04:42.204
Next time, I'll fight for the two of us.

04:42.414 --> 04:44.534
Can you fight against that guy?

04:45.384 --> 04:46.544
I dunno.

04:52.154 --> 04:54.454
There's no sense thinking about it.

04:54.594 --> 04:56.884
First, we blast Kouhei away.

04:56.964 --> 04:59.054
We'll worry about everything else later!

04:59.294 --> 05:00.384
You're right.

05:00.934 --> 05:02.894
By the way, where's Sayaka?

05:03.094 --> 05:04.564
I haven't seen her.

05:04.934 --> 05:06.064
Beats me.

05:06.264 --> 05:08.394
That lady can be so capricious.

05:16.344 --> 05:18.904
I guess I'd better do something.

05:19.514 --> 05:21.604
It seems like the problems
keep accumulating.

05:22.214 --> 05:24.584
This really has little to do with me.

05:25.054 --> 05:27.044
But I just can't leave her alone.

05:32.364 --> 05:37.264
I'm sure I went to the Shrine of the Four
Sacred Dragons on orders from RI-ON.

05:38.434 --> 05:39.594
I'm positive.

05:52.214 --> 05:54.374
N-NO!!

05:58.324 --> 06:00.944
No. I can't remember.

06:01.524 --> 06:03.454
Sorry, everyone.

06:03.594 --> 06:05.424
Sorry that I can't be of help.

06:12.334 --> 06:15.774
This is the biggest embarrassment of my life.

06:15.834 --> 06:20.074
My Sweet Darling saw me
in my underpants.

06:20.314 --> 06:21.534
Daisuke!

06:23.174 --> 06:25.574
Have you seen Kyoji?

06:27.054 --> 06:30.014
N-No, I haven't.

06:30.454 --> 06:31.314
Darn.

06:31.384 --> 06:33.354
Sayaka hasn't returned...

06:33.424 --> 06:36.794
...Rockaku did come back,
but now he won't come out of his room...

06:36.894 --> 06:39.054
Everyone's being so inconsiderate,
don't you think?

06:39.464 --> 06:40.984
Y-You're right.

06:41.094 --> 06:43.694
I'm counting on you, Daisuke.

06:47.474 --> 06:50.164
She's... counting on me.

06:52.274 --> 06:53.674
Hooray!

06:53.774 --> 06:55.474
I still have hope!

06:55.674 --> 06:56.974
Hang in there, Daisuke!

07:08.394 --> 07:10.014
We've successfully snuck in.

07:10.124 --> 07:11.784
Now, what do we do?

07:12.224 --> 07:16.524
First let's find a way to free
Lai Lai Cocoon and Chibi.

07:16.994 --> 07:18.394
That's your plan?

07:20.234 --> 07:22.204
I couldn't think of a better one.

07:35.514 --> 07:37.574
I see... So she was...

07:38.584 --> 07:40.384
She's very pretty.

07:40.694 --> 07:41.914
Who is she?

07:41.994 --> 07:44.554
- You've already met her.
- Huh?

07:46.694 --> 07:48.994
Y-You're not saying
she's that old lady, are you?

07:49.064 --> 07:51.054
Her name is Bloody Mary.

07:51.364 --> 07:53.194
She's a legendary dragon master.

07:53.264 --> 07:55.734
L-Legendary dragon master?

07:55.834 --> 07:58.064
That lady is?

07:58.604 --> 07:59.904
Come on, you're kidding.

07:59.974 --> 08:01.004
It's true.

08:02.314 --> 08:05.504
Mary was adored by
every dragon master in Rikyu.

08:06.444 --> 08:10.404
She was the best there was,
with the ability to control dragons at will.

08:12.024 --> 08:14.254
I'm not interested in
what happened ages ago.

08:14.324 --> 08:16.554
Right now, we've gotta get
Chibi and Lai Lai Cocoon back!

08:16.624 --> 08:19.254
Yeah, you're right. Sorry.

08:22.234 --> 08:24.924
Mary. Why you, of all people?

08:26.234 --> 08:27.254
Madam!

08:27.334 --> 08:31.104
Please stop joking, ma'am!

08:31.344 --> 08:32.674
I'm serious!

08:32.844 --> 08:38.214
I want to be with
my precious dragons for eternity.

08:38.344 --> 08:39.214
So...

08:39.514 --> 08:41.444
I want you to do this immediately.

08:41.884 --> 08:43.614
Please think this over!

08:43.754 --> 08:48.054
How will we get by without you, Madam?

08:48.124 --> 08:49.784
There's nothing to worry about.

08:49.854 --> 08:51.884
I'll always be by your side.

08:52.024 --> 08:55.464
In the same way the dragons are. Eternally.

09:03.204 --> 09:03.904
Chibi!

09:08.014 --> 09:09.804
Hang in there just a bit longer.

09:09.874 --> 09:12.314
We'll save you, no matter what, Chibi!

09:13.714 --> 09:16.084
If only we could do something
about that film.

09:20.894 --> 09:22.384
Let's hurry, Reiji!

09:22.454 --> 09:24.484
The dragons' level of anger is increasing.

09:30.094 --> 09:33.004
Darn! What is this guy doing here?!

09:33.134 --> 09:35.394
If we could use the power of this dragon...

09:35.474 --> 09:38.564
...we might be able to save
Lai Lai Cocoon and the others.

09:38.644 --> 09:41.074
Then why not ask it for help, Mr. Taiyou!

09:57.894 --> 10:01.524
You two are being very naughty boys.

10:02.964 --> 10:05.494
Hasn't anybody ever taught you
that it's wrong to enter someone's home...

10:05.564 --> 10:07.694
...without permission?

10:08.134 --> 10:12.004
Who are you to talk? You're the one
who mummified Chibi without permission!

10:12.244 --> 10:15.804
My, is that dragon that important to you?

10:15.974 --> 10:18.374
Then why don't I offer
to harden you two as well...

10:18.444 --> 10:21.074
...so I can display you together with it?

10:21.814 --> 10:22.974
Wh-What?!

10:23.354 --> 10:27.724
I was planning to have myself
hardened and displayed.

10:27.824 --> 10:29.294
Wish to join me?

10:29.554 --> 10:30.544
Don't be ridiculous!

10:32.024 --> 10:33.554
I'm serious.

10:35.364 --> 10:36.884
Once I've done this...

10:36.964 --> 10:40.264
...I can remain with
my precious dragons forever.

10:40.404 --> 10:41.894
Don't you think that's wonderful?

10:41.974 --> 10:44.404
Now, harden me!

10:44.544 --> 10:46.704
Just like you did to these dragons!

11:11.764 --> 11:13.734
What's the matter? Hurry up!

11:13.804 --> 11:16.164
Madam, please think this over!

11:16.234 --> 11:18.604
H-He's right, Madam.

11:18.944 --> 11:21.434
Please don't do this!

11:21.874 --> 11:22.844
Quiet!

11:25.284 --> 11:27.274
I'm not letting anyone get in my way!

11:28.054 --> 11:29.274
I've decided.

11:29.814 --> 11:32.284
I am gonna become like these dragons...

11:32.484 --> 11:35.754
...and live my life in total happiness.

11:36.054 --> 11:37.184
Bloody Mary!

11:38.124 --> 11:39.494
Please stop.

11:39.564 --> 11:42.694
I know you're not the kind of person
who would do this.

11:44.304 --> 11:47.164
It's been ages since
anyone called me by that name.

11:48.174 --> 11:49.794
Mary. Why?

11:50.004 --> 11:51.494
It's too bad.

11:52.244 --> 11:55.304
The Bloody Mary you knew is dead.

11:56.414 --> 12:00.474
Have you people ever experienced
having a dragon you loved so dearly...

12:00.714 --> 12:02.474
...die before your eyes?

12:04.024 --> 12:06.144
You want to save it, but can't.

12:06.524 --> 12:09.514
All you can do is watch,
as it slowly passes away.

12:09.594 --> 12:12.854
Have you ever experienced
anything so dreadful?

12:15.534 --> 12:17.824
Well, I have.

12:19.064 --> 12:21.934
And I will never
experience it again.

12:22.934 --> 12:27.674
I was with the dragon
ever since I was a child.

12:28.444 --> 12:33.004
She understood me better than anyone.

12:33.384 --> 12:37.044
And I could always understand
exactly what she was thinking.

12:38.824 --> 12:40.684
One day, while on a journey...

12:41.554 --> 12:43.884
...we got caught in a storm.

12:46.224 --> 12:49.524
That was when they quietly approached,
and suddenly attacked us.

12:51.764 --> 12:55.204
My dragon desperately fought to protect me.

12:57.204 --> 12:58.194
However...

13:02.444 --> 13:06.574
She was killed in the struggle...
by four terrifying dragons.

13:07.654 --> 13:09.814
NOOO!!!

13:10.414 --> 13:13.214
I couldn't do a thing.

13:13.684 --> 13:17.384
All I could do was watch hopelessly
as she passed away.

13:18.094 --> 13:19.564
So I made a decision.

13:19.724 --> 13:23.224
I would never allow
another dragon I loved to die.

13:23.434 --> 13:25.164
S-So that's why.

13:25.234 --> 13:27.724
Now that you know, stay outta my way.

13:28.274 --> 13:30.174
No matter what the reason is for doing it...

13:30.234 --> 13:32.734
...it's still not right to take
the dragons' freedom away from them.

13:33.404 --> 13:35.374
Can't you hear their cries?

13:35.444 --> 13:36.674
Of course I can hear them!

13:37.074 --> 13:39.574
The dragons here are crying for joy.

13:39.814 --> 13:42.754
They will never die fighting,
nor will they ever starve!

13:43.054 --> 13:46.514
Now, do the same for me.

13:46.584 --> 13:50.254
I will attain eternal happiness,
just like these dragons have.

13:51.964 --> 13:53.794
Don't, Madam!

13:53.864 --> 13:55.794
Please stop what you're doing!

13:55.864 --> 13:57.524
You still fail to understand!

13:57.604 --> 13:59.434
There's nothing to worry about!

13:59.504 --> 14:00.794
B-But still!

14:00.874 --> 14:02.424
Madam!

14:02.534 --> 14:05.264
The mucus that's keeping the dragons still...

14:05.504 --> 14:07.994
...is a giver of eternal life.

14:08.274 --> 14:09.764
As long as you're covered in that film...

14:09.844 --> 14:13.074
...you have no need of food,
and no risk of getting into battles.

14:13.244 --> 14:15.544
There could be nothing more wonderful.

14:15.814 --> 14:17.114
You're wrong!

14:17.384 --> 14:20.324
The dragons wish to live freely,
of their own will.

14:21.524 --> 14:25.054
Nobody is happy having their will
and freedom taken from them!

14:25.594 --> 14:28.114
Mary! You are mistaken!

14:34.904 --> 14:37.424
Wh-What's wrong, everyone?

14:44.844 --> 14:46.314
Don't get all excited!

14:46.484 --> 14:48.544
I'll put you back to the way you were!

14:59.824 --> 15:02.554
Why? Why won't you do as I say?

15:02.794 --> 15:04.994
You can continue to live
without concerns!

15:05.334 --> 15:07.064
We must get away from here, Madam!

15:07.134 --> 15:09.334
Wh-Why? Why must we escape?

15:09.404 --> 15:11.394
- Just do as we say!
- Let me go! Stop!

15:11.474 --> 15:14.104
We must stop the dragons, Reiji!

15:14.174 --> 15:15.504
I know!

15:26.554 --> 15:28.184
Thundervolt.

15:28.794 --> 15:32.524
You knew all along that
it was Mahiru attacking us, didn't you?

15:34.864 --> 15:36.024
I apologize.

15:36.364 --> 15:38.024
Of course you could not fight...

15:38.534 --> 15:40.194
...knowing it was Yakou's little brother.

15:42.804 --> 15:45.794
I cannot fight Mahiru either.

15:46.174 --> 15:48.144
What am I to do?

15:48.214 --> 15:49.874
Please tell me, Yakou!

15:59.384 --> 16:01.414
Why? I don't understand.

16:08.664 --> 16:09.634
Damn.

16:09.934 --> 16:11.264
We're cornered.

16:11.334 --> 16:13.024
Goetsu... Madam...

16:25.084 --> 16:26.544
You guys...

16:26.944 --> 16:28.074
We'll talk later!

16:28.314 --> 16:28.974
Hey!

16:29.054 --> 16:30.574
Stop the dragons from moving so much.

16:30.654 --> 16:32.384
With all this commotion, we can't even talk!

16:36.294 --> 16:39.594
That youngster and that dragon
already understand each other.

16:50.574 --> 16:51.694
Ouch!

16:52.904 --> 16:53.634
Darn!

16:53.704 --> 16:56.234
If only Chibi were here,
I'd have no problem against these dragons.

17:00.314 --> 17:01.714
Chibi.

17:17.564 --> 17:18.534
Chibi.

17:22.534 --> 17:23.504
Chibi!!

17:28.614 --> 17:30.274
Good! Chibi!

17:30.344 --> 17:32.904
Stop it! Don't fight back!

17:33.184 --> 17:33.974
Reiji.

17:34.114 --> 17:36.104
We need to calm the dragons down.

17:40.054 --> 17:41.984
- They have done nothing wrong.
- Huh?

17:42.454 --> 17:44.394
Then what are you suggesting that we do?

17:45.794 --> 17:47.384
Let them do as they wish.

17:47.564 --> 17:50.054
There's no other way
to get rid of their anger.

17:50.364 --> 17:52.094
You're kidding.

17:53.404 --> 17:54.364
Chibi...

18:12.084 --> 18:14.684
Please endure this, Chibi.

18:17.454 --> 18:20.554
Is this all because of what I've done?

18:23.594 --> 18:26.534
I can feel it. I know what the dragons feel.

18:38.914 --> 18:40.574
Have you all cooled down?

18:41.084 --> 18:42.644
Then go off to wherever you wish!

18:44.824 --> 18:46.514
You guys are free now!

18:58.264 --> 19:01.064
I'm so sorry, all of you.

19:16.114 --> 19:18.584
It looks like I was mistaken.

19:19.124 --> 19:20.914
As long as you understand that.

19:20.984 --> 19:22.514
Right, Mr. Taiyou?

19:22.594 --> 19:24.084
E-Exactly.

19:24.324 --> 19:26.084
I was gonna say that.

19:27.664 --> 19:29.224
Madam!

19:29.294 --> 19:30.924
I'm so glad!

19:30.994 --> 19:35.234
I won't ever fail you again,
so please don't fire me!

19:35.304 --> 19:36.564
It's all right.

19:36.634 --> 19:39.234
I'll never lock up dragons
like that ever again.

19:39.304 --> 19:41.644
M-Madam!

19:41.714 --> 19:46.344
From now on, let's go and search
for dragons that will be our friends.

19:46.414 --> 19:48.244
You already have one.

19:57.294 --> 19:59.784
You... haven't left me?

20:01.334 --> 20:04.024
I think that dragon loves you, ma'am.

20:04.364 --> 20:05.294
But how could you?

20:05.364 --> 20:08.064
There's nothing interesting
about an old lady like me.

20:08.134 --> 20:10.694
Madam. I love you too!

20:10.774 --> 20:13.704
Hey, Doushu. You mean we love you!

20:13.774 --> 20:15.294
A-All right.

20:15.474 --> 20:18.074
You're all gonna hafta take care of me!

20:18.744 --> 20:20.274
Why, leave it to me!

20:20.344 --> 20:21.974
Yeah!

20:23.014 --> 20:25.454
By the way, we need to ask her about that.

20:25.754 --> 20:26.554
Mhm.

20:26.624 --> 20:27.614
Ma'am.

20:27.684 --> 20:28.484
What is it?

20:28.554 --> 20:32.494
Where is it that
the four dragons assaulted you?

20:32.724 --> 20:34.494
Where is the Shrine of
the Four Sacred Dragons...

20:34.564 --> 20:36.494
...where the four dragons
you encountered reside?

20:36.764 --> 20:39.464
I'm sorry if it brings back
painful memories...

20:39.804 --> 20:41.064
...but we'd like to know.

20:42.174 --> 20:44.164
It's a horrible place.

20:44.604 --> 20:46.934
You might not return alive.

20:47.604 --> 20:49.574
But we have to go...

20:49.844 --> 20:52.314
...in order to save Rikyu and the dragons.

20:53.514 --> 20:56.174
I hate to say this,
but I don't remember too well.

20:56.484 --> 20:58.414
Although I do recall...

20:58.484 --> 21:02.114
...being caught in that storm
close to a place full of dragon skeletons.

21:02.894 --> 21:05.254
A place full of dragon skeletons...

21:05.864 --> 21:07.854
That gives us something
to base our search on.

21:07.934 --> 21:09.264
Thank you, ma'am!

21:09.364 --> 21:11.994
You'll go even if I tell you not to,
won't you?

21:12.104 --> 21:12.864
Mhm!

21:13.064 --> 21:14.534
What's your name?

21:15.234 --> 21:15.994
Me?

21:16.074 --> 21:17.594
I'm Reiji Ohzora!

21:18.004 --> 21:20.204
Reiji. Be careful.

21:20.674 --> 21:22.834
When your quest is done, come visit me.

21:23.044 --> 21:25.534
Mhm! You can count on it!

21:36.454 --> 21:39.854
Be sure to return alive, young ones.

21:57.544 --> 22:00.204
taikutsu datta
I was bored

22:00.284 --> 22:02.974
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:03.054 --> 22:06.984
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:08.454 --> 22:11.154
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:11.224 --> 22:13.384
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.864 --> 22:17.954
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:19.404 --> 22:21.994
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:22.074 --> 22:24.734
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.804 --> 22:28.764
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:30.114 --> 22:32.544
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.614 --> 22:35.544
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.614 --> 22:40.484
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:41.154 --> 22:43.814
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.894 --> 22:46.584
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.664 --> 22:51.294
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:52.034 --> 22:54.734
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.804 --> 22:57.394
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:57.474 --> 23:02.104
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.774 --> 23:07.274
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:08.214 --> 23:13.884
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:16.254 --> 23:18.854
Next time

23:18.994 --> 23:19.684
What?

23:19.764 --> 23:21.884
Daisuke and Ichirou have formed a team?

23:21.964 --> 23:22.754
A team!

23:22.834 --> 23:26.324
What? A "Journey to Search for the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons" team?

23:26.564 --> 23:28.124
I wonder if they'll be all right.

23:28.204 --> 23:29.674
They're always fighting.

23:29.734 --> 23:30.894
Combat!

23:30.974 --> 23:32.534
But we have a more serious issue!

23:32.604 --> 23:34.044
Kouhei Toki has arrived...

23:34.104 --> 23:36.664
...and he intends to capture Meguru!

23:37.374 --> 23:39.844
Next, on Dragon Drive, "Memory".

23:40.144 --> 23:43.384
Well, it's not like I care,
but what do you wanna do, Sayaka?

23:43.384 --> 23:45.874
Memory
Sayaka, come back!
